    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:418fd01c7947b0a70850f895",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是气槽采纳了这意见，\n重新审视了自己现在需要什么样的训练，\n不再一味地埋头练习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8527a3749e9c34e73b7a5fcf385d2356a428d1130737cf3d40b8f827164efff4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a037daa651a85d4cd26e8645",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以结果来说，这让她免于过度操劳，\n也让她更有效率地进行训练了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef764491d53c929dac135d28b92e29c1852da21dc620cb1ede3bc2276e8ca6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
